:name: STM32H743 bare-metal PID HIL
:description: Runs the unmodified firmware ELF on Renode's STM32H743 model and bridges UART5 to a raw TCP socket for host/plant.py.

$elf ?= @main.elf
$port ?= 3456

using sysbus
mach create "stm32h743"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/cpus/stm32h743.repl

emulation CreateServerSocketTerminal $port "uart5_tcp" false
connector Connect sysbus.uart5 uart5_tcp

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $elf
"""
runMacro $reset
